{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a1-cafe-roleplay-drinks-pay-three-real-talks-write-for-a-middle-school-student-short-words/audio/main-6af89cf4fde8.mp3","durationSec":107.544,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":2.4,"text":"A cafe order can start with a drink name."},{"start":2.4,"end":5.6,"text":"Tea and coffee are two drinks people can order."},{"start":6.3,"end":7.88,"text":"A drink can be hot or cold."},{"start":8.78,"end":10.42,"text":"The size is another part of the order."},{"start":10.42,"end":13.44,"text":"A small cup holds less than a large cup."},{"start":14.06,"end":16.2,"text":"The drink and the size go together in an order."},{"start":16.2,"end":19.12,"text":"Mara works at a cafe and makes the drinks."},{"start":19.7,"end":21.78,"text":"One person wants hot tea in a small cup."},{"start":22.52,"end":24.74,"text":"Mara hears the drink name, but not the size."},{"start":25.48,"end":27.78,"text":"She asks about the size before she makes it."},{"start":27.78,"end":30.74,"text":"The person says small, and the order is clear."},{"start":30.74,"end":33.9,"text":"Mara makes the hot tea in a small cup."},{"start":34.64,"end":36.96,"text":"People pay for their drinks when they order at this cafe."},{"start":36.96,"end":39.18,"text":"Cash is money in coins or notes."},{"start":39.62,"end":41.02,"text":"A card is another way to pay here."},{"start":41.02,"end":43.9,"text":"Mara takes both cash and cards at the counter."},{"start":44.64,"end":46.8,"text":"One person orders a coffee and wants to pay."},{"start":47.26,"end":49.48,"text":"The person has a card but has no cash."},{"start":50.26,"end":51.98,"text":"Mara says a card is fine for this order."},{"start":52.58,"end":54.94,"text":"The person uses the card to pay for the coffee."},{"start":54.94,"end":58.12,"text":"Mara says the payment is done, so the person stops."},{"start":58.88,"end":61.3,"text":"A receipt shows what the person bought and paid."},{"start":62.02,"end":64.28,"text":"The person takes the receipt and the coffee."},{"start":65.1,"end":67.74,"text":"The drink is paid for, and the order is complete."},{"start":68.76,"end":71.06,"text":"Some people drink their tea at a cafe table."},{"start":71.68,"end":73.86,"text":"Other people take their drinks away from the cafe."},{"start":74.76,"end":77.44,"text":"For here means the person will stay at the cafe."},{"start":78.24,"end":80.96,"text":"To go means the person will take the drink away."},{"start":81.72,"end":84.42,"text":"Mara asks this before she gives someone a drink."},{"start":85.52,"end":87.68,"text":"One person orders a small tea to go."},{"start":88.6,"end":90.9,"text":"Mara puts a large cup on the counter by mistake."},{"start":91.62,"end":94.48,"text":"The person sees the cup before Mara makes the tea."},{"start":94.96,"end":97.48,"text":"The order was for a small tea, not a large tea."},{"start":98.06,"end":99.7,"text":"The person asks for a small cup."},{"start":100.58,"end":103.18,"text":"Mara takes a small cup and makes the tea."},{"start":104,"end":106.94,"text":"The person takes the small tea away from the cafe."}],"words":[{"text":"A","start":0,"end":0.18},{"text":"cafe","start":0.18,"end":0.52},{"text":"order","start":0.52,"end":0.76},{"text":"can","start":0.76,"end":1.04},{"text":"start","start":1.04,"end":1.36},{"text":"with","start":1.36,"end":1.56},{"text":"a","start":1.56,"end":1.76},{"text":"drink","start":1.76,"end":2.02},{"text":"name","start":2.02,"end":2.4},{"text":"Tea","start":2.4,"end":3.32},{"text":"and","start":3.32,"end":3.56},{"text":"coffee","start":3.56,"end":3.94},{"text":"are","start":3.94,"end":4.24},{"text":"two","start":4.24,"end":4.52},{"text":"drinks","start":4.52,"end":4.82},{"text":"people","start":4.82,"end":5.06},{"text":"can","start":5.06,"end":5.32},{"text":"order","start":5.32,"end":5.6},{"text":"A","start":6.3,"end":6.32},{"text":"drink","start":6.32,"end":6.56},{"text":"can","start":6.56,"end":6.82},{"text":"be","start":6.